WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:11.417
♪♪ 

00:00:11.417 --> 00:00:12.417
Chevon:
Ghostwriter's back. 

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:13.750
♪♪

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.958
Donna:
Ghostwriter is bringing Ruben's
paintings to life.

00:00:17.292 --> 00:00:19.750
Curtis:
Up until now we thought Ruben's
grandma was Ghostwriter.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.167
This ghost is basically a
stranger.

00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:24.167
Whoa, GW's painting.

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:26.792
At this point
anything's possible.

00:00:26.792 --> 00:00:27.792
(Dragon noise)

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Ruben:
Mystery's intense.

00:00:32.042 --> 00:00:34.208
Donna: Sherlock Holmes.
Ruben: Dr. Watson.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:35.458
We need help solving a case.

00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:38.458
If you want to solve this case,
let the facts lead you.

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:40.750
Ruben:
It's like his face is hidden on
purpose.

00:00:41.542 --> 00:00:42.542
I have an idea.

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:47.083
This technology is fantastic.

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:48.083
No kidding, Sherlock.

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:49.875
♪♪

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:50.875
Ruben:
Look!

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.125
Ruben
We have to solve this mystery.

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:54.333
♪♪

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:55.875
Our ghost will finally be at
peace.

00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:58.000
♪♪

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.000
(Dragon sounds)

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.000
♪♪

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.083
Ruben:
Get down!

00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:06.750
Remember you're only visible to
me and my friends.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.000
♪♪

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Amy:
What are you doing?

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.208
-Uh!
-We're practicing our miming.

00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:14.417
Okay.

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:18.792
♪♪

00:01:18.792 --> 00:01:22.250
Be nice.
You can be friends.
(Creature sounds)

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:23.958
(Fire breathing sound)

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:25.042
(Whimpering)

00:01:25.042 --> 00:01:26.292
That dragon is bad news.

00:01:26.292 --> 00:01:27.292
(Whimpering)

